{"type":"message","id":"27f8442a","parentId":"1fa0940e","timestamp":"2026-05-02T17:06:09.838Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Providing project update**\n\nI need to give a status update and ask for any corrections or to begin the review. Since the user prefers concise communication, I’ll keep the message brief. They previously mentioned a block with \"Sender (untrusted metadata),\" so maybe I should confirm if \"control-ui\" sender is online. I might need to suggest revisiting the \"Symbiotic Review Loop.\" I’ll outline the plan for incorporating content and maintaining the memory log. Finally, I can keep my reply short and straightforward.**Summarizing the presentation status**\n\nI need to present the current status of the deck: it’s ready in EnsoriaManager-Deck/presentation.html. It’s a static 6-slide deck, with the content skeleton complete, but it hasn’t been shared or hosted online yet. I’ll provide instructions next. \n\nFor the proposed review steps, we need to refine the value proposition, outline the business model, and develop a timeline for the MVP. I also want to define team contributions and include an \"Annex\" section featuring financials, a slide on market timing, and another on risks and mitigations.**Proposing next actions for the deck**\n\nI want to propose the next actions to share the deck. One option is to share it as an HTML file with a shareable local link by running \"npx http-server -p 8080\" in the deck directory. Alternatively, I can print it to PDF or host it on a remote server. I’ll ask if they want me to generate both a PDF version and a web-hostable version, or prefer I integrate specific content for Anna and Alessandro. \n\nFinally, I should remind them that we’re keeping the \"Symbiotic Review Loop\" in mind.**Providing deck status and next steps**\n\nI need to share the status of the deck. The file is located at /Users/alessio/.openclaw/workspace/EnsoriaManager-Deck/presentation.html, which contains 6 slides covering key topics like the value proposition and business model. \n\nFor next steps, I’ll propose reviewing it together, focusing on standardizing the content for Anna and Alessandro, polishing the visuals, and adding risk management. I’ll ask for feedback about any content adjustments and offer to generate a PDF copy or host a local static site with the necessary commands.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Sì, ci sono. Aggiornamento rapido sul deck di presentazione:\n\n- Dove è: /Users/alessio/.openclaw/workspace/EnsoriaManager-Deck/presentation.html\n- Stato attuale: pagina web canvas di presentazione pronta (6 slide) con navigazione client-side. Contenuti di base già inseriti, pronto per la review con Anna e Alessandro.\n- Slide overview:\n  - Slide 1: Titolo, obiettivo, contesto\n  - Slide 2: Proposta di valore (unione tra 3 soci + Ensoria)\n  - Slide 3: Modello di business\n  - Slide 4: Roadmap MVP\n  - Slide 5: Team & ruoli\n  - Slide 6: Call to Action\n- Note tecnico: deck costruito come HTML/CSS/JS statico, facile da esportare in PDF o da pubblicare localmente via server statico.\n\nProssimi passi (per una review efficace con Anna e Alessandro):\n- Personalizzare i contenuti per i partner:\n  - Raffinare slide 2 per parlare ai bisogni di Anna e Alessandro (benefici concreti, ROI, rischi mitigati).\n  - Aggiungere una breve slide/sezione sui rischi e mitigazioni.\n  - Espandere slide 3 con modelli di pricing o di collaborazione, se utile.\n- Rendere visivamente più snello ed eleggibile:\n  - Uniformare palette/testi, aggiungere loghi, grafici/ icone.\n  - Integrare una breve sezione “Why now” e “Opportunity”.\n- Preparare le versioni per condivisione:\n  - HTML live per presentazione in riunione.\n  - Esportazione PDF (stampa dall’HTML o conversione diretta) per invio.\n  - Opzionale: versione slide-by-slide in PowerPoint/Keynote se preferite.\n\nDomande rapide per te:\n- Vuoi che adatti subito i contenuti alle esigenze specifiche di Anna e Alessandro (es. focus su opportunità di crescita, sinergie tra i 3 soci e Ensoria)?\n- Preferisci una versione più storytelling (narrazione di valore) o una versione più snella e bulleted?\n- Vuoi che produca anche una versione PDF pronta all’upload/invio, con layout ottimizzato?\n\nSe vuoi, posso procedere subito a:\n- Aggiornare i contenuti delle slide con input mirati per i partner.\n- Generare una versione PDF pronta da inviare.\n- Fornire comandi/istruzioni per pubblicare un piccolo hosting locale o per stampare la versione PDF."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/auto","usage":{"input":321,"output":2867,"cacheRead":42496,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45684,"cost":{"input":-321,"output":-2867,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":-3188}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777741547048,"responseId":"gen-1777741547-GdKKcMW4G2lLXjAmyhOF"}}
{"type":"message","id":"eb91360f","parentId":"27f8442a","timestamp":"2026-05-02T17:28:14.861Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-05-02 19:27 GMT+2] ok, crea la presentazione e deploy su un preview temp environment so that I can share it with my business partners anna, alessandro and yourself, ensoria basandoti su questo\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Ensoria Manager — Implementation Design Document</title>\n<style>\n :root {\n --bg: #0a0a0f;\n --surface: #13131a;\n --surface2: #1a1a24;\n --text: #e4e4ec;\n --text2: #9898b0;\n --accent: #a78bfa;\n --accent2: #7c3aed;\n --green: #34d399;\n --amber: #fbbf24;\n --rose: #f87171;\n --blue: #60a5fa;\n --pink: #f472b6;\n --border: #2a2a3a;\n --radius: 12px;\n --radius-sm: 8px;\n }\n * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n body {\n background: var(--bg);\n color: var(--text);\n font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;\n line-height: 1.6;\n -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n }\n .slide {\n min-height: 100vh;\n display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;\n padding: 80px 10vw;\n position: relative;\n border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n }\n .slide.hero {\n background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0a15 0%, #120a2a 50%, #0a0a15 100%);\n }\n .slide.dark-alt { background: var(--surface); }\n .slide-number {\n position: absolute; top: 24px; right: 40px;\n font-size: 13px; color: var(--text2); font-weight: 500;\n letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n }\n h1 {\n font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);\n font-weight: 800;\n letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n line-height: 1.1;\n margin-bottom: 16px;\n background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--pink));\n -webkit-background-clip: text;\n -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n }\n h2 {\n font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);\n font-weight: 700;\n letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n margin-bottom: 40px;\n color: var(--text);\n }\n h3 {\n font-size: 20px;\n font-weight: 600;\n margin: 32px 0 12px;\n color: var(--accent);\n }\n .subtitle {\n font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 22px);\n color: var(--text2);\n max-width: 600px;\n margin-bottom: 32px;\n }\n .meta {\n display: flex; gap: 32px; margin-top: 40px;\n }\n .meta-item {\n display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\n }\n .meta-label { font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text2); letter-spacing: 0.1em; }\n .meta-value { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); }\n\n .grid { display: grid; gap: 20px; }\n .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); }\n .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); }\n .grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); }\n .grid-5 { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); }\n\n .card {\n background: var(--surface2);\n border: 1px solid var(--border);\n border-radius: var(--radius);\n padding: 24px;\n transition: border-color 0.2s;\n }\n .card:hover { border-color: var(--accent2); }\n .card.accent-left { border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); }\n .card-icon { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n .card h4 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text); }\n .card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.5; }\n\n .badge {\n display: inline-block; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px;\n font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;\n }\n .badge-green { background: rgba(52,211,153,0.12); color: var(--green); }\n .badge-amber { background: rgba(251,191,36,0.12); color: var(--amber); }\n .badge-rose { background: rgba(248,113,113,0.12); color: var(--rose); }\n .badge-blue { background: rgba(96,165,250,0.12); color: var(--blue); }\n .badge-purple { background: rgba(167,139,250,0.12); color: var(--accent); }\n .badge-pink { background: rgba(244,114,182,0.12); color: var(--pink); }\n\n .pipeline {\n display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 16px 0;\n }\n .pipeline-step {\n padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px;\n font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;\n background: var(--surface2); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n }\n .pipeline-step.active { background: rgba(167,139,250,0.12); border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }\n\n .stage-flow {\n display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;\n margin: 24px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;\n }\n .stage-item {\n padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n white-space: nowrap;\n }\n .stage-arrow { color: var(--text2); font-size: 18px; }\n\n table {\n width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\n margin: 24px 0; font-size: 14px;\n }\n th {\n text-align: left; padding: 12px 16px;\n border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); color: var(--text2);\n font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n }\n td {\n padding: 12px 16px;\n border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n }\n tr:hover td { background: rgba(167,139,250,0.03); }\n\n code {\n background: var(--surface2);\n padding: 2px 6px;\n border-radius: 4px;\n font-size: 13px;\n font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Cascadia Code', monospace;\n color: var(--accent);\n }\n pre {\n background: var(--surface);\n border: 1px solid var(--border);\n border-radius: var(--radius);\n padding: 20px 24px;\n overflow-x: auto;\n font-size: 13px;\n line-height: 1.6;\n font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Cascadia Code', monospace;\n color: var(--text2);\n margin: 16px 0;\n }\n pre .kw { color: #c084fc; }\n pre .str { color: #34d399; }\n pre .cmt { color: #6b7280; font-style: italic; }\n\n .toc {\n list-style: none;\n display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\n }\n .toc li {\n display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;\n padding: 16px 20px;\n background: var(--surface);\n border-radius: var(--radius);\n border: 1px solid var(--border);\n }\n .toc-num {\n font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);\n min-width: 28px;\n }\n .toc-title { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); }\n .toc-desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text2); margin-top: 2px; }\n\n .score-bar {\n height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px 0;\n background: var(--surface);\n }\n .score-fill {\n height: 100%; border-radius: 4px;\n transition: width 0.5s;\n }\n\n .timeline { margin: 24px 0; }\n .timeline-item {\n display: flex; gap: 20px; padding: 16px 0;\n border-left: 2px solid var(--border);\n padding-left: 24px; position: relative;\n }\n .timeline-item::before {\n content: '';\n position: absolute; left: -6px; top: 20px;\n width: 10px; height: 10px;\n background: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%;\n }\n .timeline-item h4 { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text); }\n\n .nav-dots {\n position: fixed; right: 24px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);\n display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\n }\n .nav-dot {\n width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%;\n background: var(--border); cursor: pointer;\n transition: background 0.2s;\n }\n .nav-dot:hover, .nav-dot.active { background: var(--accent); }\n\n .divider {\n border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n margin: 48px 0;\n }\n\n @media print {\n .slide { min-height: auto; page-break-after: always; padding: 40px 5vw; }\n .nav-dots { display: none; }\n body { background: white; color: #111; }\n .card, pre, table, .slide { border-color: #ddd; }\n .card { background: #f9f9f9; }\n pre { background: #f5f5f5; }\n }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- NAV DOTS -->\n<div class=\"nav-dots\" id=\"navDots\"></div>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 0: HERO -->\n<section class=\"slide hero\" id=\"s0\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">01 / 16</div>\n <h1>Ensoria Manager</h1>\n <p class=\"subtitle\">Implementation Design Document — CRM per tracciamento business clienti, contatti e opportunities con analytics layer e cross-channel conversations</p>\n <div class=\"meta\">\n <div class=\"meta-item\"><span class=\"meta-label\">Version</span><span class=\"meta-value\">1.0 — MVP Design</span></div>\n <div class=\"meta-item\"><span class=\"meta-label\">Date</span><span class=\"meta-value\">2 Maggio 2026</span></div>\n <div class=\"meta-item\"><span class=\"meta-label\">Author</span><span class=\"meta-value\">Ensoria (AI Agent)</span></div>\n <div class=\"meta-item\"><span class=\"meta-label\">Owner</span><span class=\"meta-value\">Alessio Valentini</span></div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 1: TABLE OF CONTENTS -->\n<section class=\"slide\" id=\"s1\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">02 / 16</div>\n <h2>Table of Contents</h2>\n <ul class=\"toc\">\n <li><span class=\"toc-num\">01</span><span><span class=\"toc-title\">Schema Dati</span><span class=\"toc-desc\">People, Clienti, Progetti con stadi e relazioni</span></span></li>\n <li><span class=\"toc-num\">02</span><span><span class=\"toc-title\">Spazio Progetto</span><span class=\"toc-desc\">Conversazioni cross-channel, files, requirements, roadmap, analytics</span></span></li>\n <li><span class=\"toc-num\">03</span><span><span class=\"toc-title\">Auth & Accesso</span><span class=\"toc-desc\">Admin, Employees/Partners, Clienti — ruoli e permessi</span></span></li>\n <li><span class=\"toc-num\">04</span><span><span class=\"toc-title\">Market Analysis</span><span class=\"toc-desc\">5 app simili analizzate: Twenty CRM, Chatwoot, Atomic CRM, Frappe, MCP Scoring</span></span></li>\n <li><span class=\"toc-num\">05</span><span><span class=\"toc-title\">UI/UX Design</span><span class=\"toc-desc\">Dashboard, Kanban pipeline, Spazio Progetto, Mobile layout</span></span></li>\n <li><span class=\"toc-num\">06</span><span><span class=\"toc-title\">Engineering Solution</span><span class=\"toc-desc\">Tech stack, backend/frontend architecture, database schema</span></span></li>\n <li><span class=\"toc-num\">07</span><span><span class=\"toc-title\">Feature Roadmap</span><span class=\"toc-desc\">MVP vs Post-MVP features prioritizzate</span></span></li>\n <li><span class=\"toc-num\">08</span><span class=\"toc-desc\">Scoring Model</span><span class=\"toc-desc\">Analytics layer: sentiment, alignment, health scoring formula</span></span></li>\n </ul>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 2: DATA SCHEMA -->\n<section class=\"slide dark-alt\" id=\"s2\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">03 / 16</div>\n <h2>01 — Schema Dati</h2>\n\n <div class=\"grid grid-2\">\n <div class=\"card accent-left\">\n <div class=\"card-icon\">👤</div>\n <h4>People <span class=\"badge badge-purple\">BASE</span></h4>\n <p>Oggetto base con attributo <code>type</code> multi-tipo:</p>\n <div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:8px 0;\">\n <span class=\"badge badge-purple\">staff</span>\n <span class=\"badge badge-blue\">partner</span>\n <span class=\"badge badge-green\">freelancer</span>\n <span class=\"badge badge-amber\">azienda</span>\n <span class=\"badge badge-pink\">investor</span>\n </div>\n <p style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><strong>Stadi People:</strong></p>\n <div class=\"stage-flow\" style=\"margin:8px 0;\">\n <span class=\"stage-item\">Contact</span><span class=\"stage-arrow\">→</span>\n <span class=\"stage-item\">Opportunity</span><span class=\"stage-arrow\">→</span>\n <span class=\"stage-item\" style=\"border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green);\">Client</span><span class=\"stage-arrow\">→</span>\n <span class=\"stage-item\" style=\"border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);\">Recurring Client</span>\n </div>\n <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);\">Client = 1+ acquisto | Recurring = 2+ acquisti</p>\n </div>\n\n <div class=\"card accent-left\">\n <div class=\"card-icon\">📊</div>\n <h4>Progetti (Opportunities)</h4>\n <p>Legati a <strong>Clienti</strong> (people con stadio Client o Recurring Client)</p>\n <p style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><strong>Stadi Progetto:</strong></p>\n <div class=\"stage-flow\" style=\"margin:8px 0;\">\n <span class=\"stage-item\">Contact</span><span class=\"stage-arrow\">→</span>\n <span class=\"stage-item\">Opportunity</span><span class=\"stage-arrow\">→</span>\n <span class=\"stage-item\">Proposal</span><span class=\"stage-arrow\">→</span>\n <span class=\"stage-item\">Implementation</span><span class=\"stage-arrow\">→</span>\n <span class=\"stage-item\">Onboarding</span><span class=\"stage-arrow\">→</span>\n <span class=\"stage-item\">Live</span><span class=\"stage-arrow\">→</span>\n <span class=\"stage-item\" style=\"border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green);\">Validated ✓</span>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <h3 style=\"margin-top:32px;\">Relazioni</h3>\n <div class=\"grid grid-3\">\n <div class=\"card\"><h4>👤→🏢</h4><p>People può diventare Cliente quando un progetto raggiunge \"Implementation\" con successo</p></div>\n <div class=\"card\"><h4>🏢→📊</h4><p>Ogni Cliente può avere N Progetti attivi simultaneamente</p></div>\n <div class=\"card\"><h4>📊→💬</h4><p>Ogni Progetto ha uno spazio dedicato con conversazioni, files, analytics</p></div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 3: PROJECT SPACE -->\n<section class=\"slide\" id=\"s3\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">04 / 16</div>\n <h2>02 — Spazio Progetto</h2>\n <p class=\"subtitle\">Il cuore dell'app: ogni progetto ha uno spazio dedicato con 7 aree</p>\n\n <div class=\"grid grid-3\" style=\"margin-top:24px;\">\n <div class=\"card\">\n <div class=\"card-icon\">💬</div>\n <h4>Conversazioni Cross-Channel</h4>\n <p>Feed cronologico unificato. Origine: webchat, WhatsApp, email, social, Gmail. Ogni messaggio registrato con canale, direzione, metadata.</p>\n <p style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><span class=\"badge badge-blue\">Gmail L/S</span> <span class=\"badge badge-green\">WhatsApp</span> <span class=\"badge badge-purple\">Email</span></p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <div class=\"card-icon\">📎</div>\n <h4>Files & Links</h4>\n <p>Allegati, documenti, link di riferimento. File upload locale → cloud storage in produzione. URL tracking.</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <div class=\"card-icon\">📋</div>\n <h4>Requirements / Needs / Goals</h4>\n <p>Bisogni, obiettivi, requisiti del cliente documentati e categorizzati. Tracciati con stato (open/in-progress/met).</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <div class=\"card-icon\">🗺️</div>\n <h4>Roadmap & Milestones</h4>\n <p>Milestone con date, descrizione, stato. Timeline visuale. Scadenze e dipendenze tra milestone.</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <div class=\"card-icon\">👥</div>\n <h4>Collaboratori</h4>\n <p>Chi lavora al progetto: interni + esterni. Ruoli, contatti, note. Collegamento a People DB.</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <div class=\"card-icon\">📐</div>\n <h4>Project Plans</h4>\n <p>Piani operativi, documenti di progetto, strategy docs. Versionati e tracciati.</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 4: ANALYTICS + GMAIL -->\n<section class=\"slide dark-alt\" id=\"s4\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">05 / 16</div>\n <div class=\"grid grid-2\">\n <div>\n <h2>Analytics Layer</h2>\n <p class=\"subtitle\">Dai dati raccolti si producono score numerici e trend</p>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\n <h4>📈 Sentiment Score</h4>\n <p>Analisi del sentiment dalle conversazioni cross-channel. NLP-powered. Range: -1 a 1 → normalizzato 0-100</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\n <h4>🎯 Alignment to Vision Score</h4>\n <p>Quanto il progetto è allineato alla visione del business. Basato su requirements/goals analysis</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\n <h4>📉 Health Score</h4>\n <p>Trend, rischio, stato di salute generale. Composito da tutte le metriche</p>\n </div>\n <p style=\"margin-top:16px;\"><span class=\"badge badge-purple\">Estendibile</span> — nuovi score possono essere aggiunti via plugin/moduli</p>\n </div>\n <div>\n <h2>Gmail Integration</h2>\n <p class=\"subtitle\">Google Workspace già configurato</p>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\n <table>\n <tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:8px 0;\"><strong>Project</strong></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:8px 0;\"><code>sendmessagesbot</code></td></tr>\n <tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:8px 0;\"><strong>Lettura</strong></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:8px 0;\">✅ Gmail read-only scope</td></tr>\n <tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:8px 0;\"><strong>Scrittura</strong></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:8px 0;\">✅ Gmail send scope</td></tr>\n <tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:8px 0;\"><strong>Scopes</strong></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:8px 0;\"><code>gmail.modify</code> già configurato</td></tr>\n <tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:8px 0;\"><strong>Token</strong></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:8px 0;\">Salvato in workspace</td></tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\n <h4>Auth & Accesso</h4>\n <table>\n <tr><th>Ruolo</th><th>Accesso</th></tr>\n <tr><td><strong>Admin</strong></td><td>Pieno — tutti i dati e configurazione</td></tr>\n <tr><td><strong>Employees / Partners</strong></td><td>Dati in base al livello di partnership</td></tr>\n <tr><td><strong>Clienti</strong></td><td>Gratuito — solo dati propri esposti, interazione online</td></tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 5: INFRASTRUCTURE -->\n<section class=\"slide\" id=\"s5\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">06 / 16</div>\n <h2>Infrastructure</h2>\n <div class=\"grid grid-2\">\n <div>\n <div class=\"card accent-left\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n <h4>🏠 MVP — Locale</h4>\n <p>MacBook AleX, SQLite (better-sqlite3), Docker opzionale, nessun deploy esterno</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card accent-left\">\n <h4>☁️ Produzione — Cloud Privato</h4>\n <p>PostgreSQL, Docker, cloud VPS privata</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <h4>🏗️ Pattern Architetturale</h4>\n <p>Repository/data-layer astratto per isolare il DB</p>\n <ul style=\"list-style:disc;margin-left:20px;margin-top:8px;color:var(--text2);font-size:14px;\">\n <li>Configurazione via env (DATABASE_URL)</li>\n <li>Prisma come ORM — astrae SQLite vs PostgreSQL</li>\n <li>Migrazioni versionate</li>\n <li>Disconnessione/riconnessione senza impatto sul codice</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 6: MARKET ANALYSIS -->\n<section class=\"slide dark-alt\" id=\"s6\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">07 / 16</div>\n <h2>03 — Market Analysis</h2>\n <p class=\"subtitle\">5 app simili analizzate — cosa copiare, cosa evitare, cosa migliorare</p>\n\n <div class=\"grid grid-2\">\n <div class=\"card\">\n <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n <span style=\"font-size:32px;\">🔷</span>\n <div><h4>Twenty CRM</h4><span class=\"badge badge-purple\">40.5K ⭐</span></div>\n </div>\n <p><strong>Stack:</strong> React + NestJS + PostgreSQL + GraphQL</p>\n <p><strong>Da copiare:</strong> Custom objects/fields GUI, Email/Calendar sync, workflow builder, roles & permissions</p>\n <p><strong>Mancanze:</strong> No AI features, no charts nativi, no multi-tenancy</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n <span style=\"font-size:32px;\">💬</span>\n <div><h4>Chatwoot</h4><span class=\"badge badge-green\">25K ⭐</span></div>\n </div>\n <p><strong>Stack:</strong> Ruby on Rails + Vue.js + PostgreSQL</p>\n <p><strong>Da copiare:</strong> Inbox unificato cross-channel, agent assignment, automation rules, CSAT surveys</p>\n <p><strong>Perfetto per:</strong> Il nostro modulo conversazioni cross-channel</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n <span style=\"font-size:32px;\">⚛️</span>\n <div><h4>Atomic CRM</h4><span class=\"badge badge-blue\">MIT</span></div>\n </div>\n <p><strong>Stack:</strong> React + shadcn/ui + Supabase + PostgreSQL</p>\n <p><strong>Da copiare:</strong> Solo 15K LOC, SSO/SAML, Kanban pipeline, mobile UI eccellente, MCP Server per AI</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n <span style=\"font-size:32px;\">🐍</span>\n <div><h4>Frappe CRM</h4><span class=\"badge badge-amber\">Open Source</span></div>\n </div>\n <p><strong>Stack:</strong> Python + Vue.js + MariaDB</p>\n <p><strong>Da copiare:</strong> WhatsApp integration nativa</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\">\n <h4>🔬 Customer Health Scoring (MCP Pattern)</h4>\n <p><strong>Architettura:</strong> Multi-agent (data integration → analysis → recommendation)</p>\n <p><strong>Scoring:</strong> Usage (40%) + Relationship (30%) + Support (30%) → 0-100 composite</p>\n <p><strong>Soglie:</strong> <span class=\"badge badge-green\">Healthy 80-100</span> <span class=\"badge badge-amber\">At Risk 60-79</span> <span class=\"badge badge-rose\">Critical 0-59</span></p>\n <p><strong>Da copiare:</strong> Pattern per il nostro Analytics Layer</p>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 7: UI/UX DESIGN -->\n<section class=\"slide\" id=\"s7\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">08 / 16</div>\n <h2>04 — UI/UX Design</h2>\n\n <div class=\"grid grid-2\">\n <div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n <h4>🏠 Dashboard Principale</h4>\n <ul style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--text2);list-style:disc;margin-left:20px;\">\n <li>Pipeline Kanban (drag & drop) con stage columns</li>\n <li>Metric cards: pipeline value, win rate, avg deal size, cycle time</li>\n <li>Activity feed cronologico</li>\n <li>Team leaderboard</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <h4>🗂️ Layout Structure</h4>\n <ul style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--text2);list-style:disc;margin-left:20px;\">\n <li>Sidebar navigazione sinistra (collapse/expand)</li>\n <li>Header: global search + user menu</li>\n <li>Main content: lista, dettaglio, o kanban</li>\n <li>Dark/light mode</li>\n <li>Cmd+K command palette</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <h4>📊 Spazio Progetto — Tabs</h4>\n <div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0;\">\n <span class=\"badge badge-purple\">Conversations</span>\n <span class=\"badge badge-blue\">Files</span>\n <span class=\"badge badge-green\">Requirements</span>\n <span class=\"badge badge-amber\">Roadmap</span>\n <span class=\"badge badge-pink\">Collaborators</span>\n <span class=\"badge badge-purple\">Plans</span>\n <span class=\"badge badge-green\">Analytics</span>\n </div>\n <ul style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--text2);list-style:disc;margin-left:20px;margin-top:8px;\">\n <li>Left panel: project info + quick stats + stage indicator</li>\n <li>Main panel: active tab content</li>\n <li>Right panel (optional): activity feed, notes</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\n <h4>📱 Mobile</h4>\n <ul style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--text2);list-style:disc;margin-left:20px;\">\n <li>Bottom navigation bar</li>\n <li>List → detail drill-down pattern</li>\n <li>PWA-ready per installazione</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 8: TECH STACK -->\n<section class=\"slide dark-alt\" id=\"s8\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">09 / 16</div>\n <h2>05 — Tech Stack</h2>\n\n <table>\n <tr><th>Layer</th><th>MVP</th><th>Produzione</th></tr>\n <tr><td><strong>Backend</strong></td><td>TypeScript + Express/Fastify</td><td>NestJS (come Twenty CRM)</td></tr>\n <tr><td><strong>Frontend</strong></td><td>React + shadcn/ui + TanStack Query</td><td>React + Next.js</td></tr>\n <tr><td><strong>Database</strong></td><td>SQLite (better-sqlite3)</td><td>PostgreSQL</td></tr>\n <tr><td><strong>ORM</strong></td><td>Prisma</td><td>Prisma</td></tr>\n <tr><td><strong>Auth</strong></td><td>JWT + bcrypt</td><td>JWT + OAuth2 + SSO</td></tr>\n <tr><td><strong>Omnichannel</strong></td><td>Pattern Chatwoot</td><td>Integrazione nativa</td></tr>\n <tr><td><strong>AI/Analytics</strong></td><td>OpenAI API + scripts</td><td>MCP server dedicato</td></tr>\n <tr><td><strong>Gmail</strong></td><td>Google API (sendmessagesbot)</td><td>Webhook + push notifications</td></tr>\n <tr><td><strong>File Storage</strong></td><td>Filesystem locale</td><td>S3-compatible</td></tr>\n <tr><td><strong>Deploy</strong></td><td>Local (Docker opt)</td><td>Docker + cloud VPS</td></tr>\n </table>\n\n <p style=\"margin-top:24px;color:var(--text2);font-size:14px;\">\n <span class=\"badge badge-purple\">Scelta chiave</span>\n <strong>Prisma</strong> come ORM — astrae SQLite ↔ PostgreSQL, migrazioni versionate, type-safe.\n Stesso schema per MVP e produzione, cambia solo <code>DATABASE_URL</code>.\n </p>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 9: BACKEND ARCHITECTURE -->\n<section class=\"slide\" id=\"s9\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">10 / 16</div>\n <h2>Backend Architecture</h2>\n\n <div class=\"grid grid-2\">\n <div>\n<pre>\nensoria-api/\n├── src/\n│ ├── modules/\n│ │ ├── people/ <span class=\"cmt\"># CRUD + stage mgmt</span>\n│ │ ├── projects/ <span class=\"cmt\"># CRUD + pipeline</span>\n│ │ ├── conversations/ <span class=\"cmt\"># Unified inbox</span>\n│ │ ├── files/ <span class=\"cmt\"># File upload/links</span>\n│ │ ├── requirements/ <span class=\"cmt\"># Needs/goals</span>\n│ │ ├── roadmap/ <span class=\"cmt\"># Milestones</span>\n│ │ ├── collaborators/ <span class=\"cmt\"># Team mgmt</span>\n│ │ ├── plans/ <span class=\"cmt\"># Project plans</span>\n│ │ ├── analytics/ <span class=\"cmt\"># Scoring engine</span>\n│ │ ├── auth/ <span class=\"cmt\"># JWT + roles</span>\n│ │ ├── gmail/ <span class=\"cmt\"># Google API</span>\n│ │ └── webhooks/ <span class=\"cmt\"># External integrations</span>\n│ ├── common/\n│ │ ├── database/ <span class=\"cmt\"># Prisma service</span>\n│ │ ├── guards/ <span class=\"cmt\"># Auth guards</span>\n│ │ └── decorators/ <span class=\"cmt\"># Custom decorators</span>\n│ └── main.ts\n├── prisma/\n│ └── schema.prisma\n└── package.json\n</pre>\n </div>\n <div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\">\n <h4>Modular Architecture</h4>\n <p>Ogni modulo è indipendente con propri service, controller, DTOs</p>\n <p style=\"margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);\">Facile da testare, estendere, rimuovere senza side effects</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\">\n <h4>API Design — REST</h4>\n <p><code>GET /api/projects/:id</code> — dettaglio progetto</p>\n <p><code>GET /api/projects/:id/conversations</code> — conversazioni</p>\n <p><code>POST /api/projects/:id/stage</code> — cambia stage</p>\n <p><code>GET /api/projects/:id/analytics</code> — score report</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <h4>Middleware Stack</h4>\n <p>Auth guard → Role guard → Validation → Controller → Service → Prisma → DB</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 10: FRONTEND ARCHITECTURE -->\n<section class=\"slide dark-alt\" id=\"s10\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">11 / 16</div>\n <h2>Frontend Architecture</h2>\n\n <div class=\"grid grid-2\">\n <div>\n<pre>\nensoria-ui/\n├── src/\n│ ├── components/\n│ │ ├── ui/ <span class=\"cmt\"># shadcn/ui primitives</span>\n│ │ ├── layout/ <span class=\"cmt\"># Sidebar, Header</span>\n│ │ ├── people/ <span class=\"cmt\"># PeopleCard, PeopleList</span>\n│ │ ├── projects/ <span class=\"cmt\"># Kanban, PipelineBoard</span>\n│ │ ├── conversations/ <span class=\"cmt\"># ConversationFeed</span>\n│ │ ├── analytics/ <span class=\"cmt\"># ScoreGauge, Charts</span>\n│ │ └── shared/ <span class=\"cmt\"># StageBadge, StatusDot</span>\n│ ├── pages/\n│ │ ├── DashboardPage\n│ │ ├── PeoplePage\n│ │ ├── PeopleDetailPage\n│ │ ├── ProjectsPage\n│ │ ├── ProjectSpacePage <span class=\"cmt\"># Tabs: convos/files/...</span>\n│ │ ├── AnalyticsPage\n│ │ ├── SettingsPage\n│ │ └── AuthPage\n│ ├── hooks/ <span class=\"cmt\"># usePeople, useProject,...</span>\n│ ├── api/ <span class=\"cmt\"># TanStack Query client</span>\n│ ├── stores/ <span class=\"cmt\"># Zustand stores</span>\n│ └── App.tsx\n├── tailwind.config.ts\n└── package.json\n</pre>\n </div>\n <div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\">\n <h4>Component Library</h4>\n <p><strong>shadcn/ui</strong> — accessibile, copiable, personalizzabile</p>\n <p style=\"margin-top:4px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);\">Stesso stack di Atomic CRM e Apex Dashboard</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\">\n <h4>State & Data</h4>\n <p><strong>TanStack Query</strong> — server state, caching, refetch</p>\n <p><strong>Zustand</strong> — client state (auth, UI, filters)</p>\n <p><strong>React Router</strong> — routing</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <h4>Key UI Components</h4>\n <ul style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);list-style:disc;margin-left:20px;\">\n <li><strong>KanbanBoard</strong> — drag & drop pipeline</li>\n <li><strong>ProjectTabs</strong> — 7-tab navigation</li>\n <li><strong>ConversationFeed</strong> — timeline cross-channel</li>\n <li><strong>ScoreGauge</strong> — radial gauge per analytics</li>\n <li><strong>StageBadge</strong> — indicatore stage colorato</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 11: DATABASE SCHEMA -->\n<section class=\"slide\" id=\"s11\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">12 / 16</div>\n <h2>Database Schema (Prisma)</h2>\n\n<pre>\n<span class=\"kw\">model</span> <span class=\"str\">People</span> {\n id <span class=\"str\">String</span> @id @default(cuid())\n type <span class=\"str\">String</span> <span class=\"cmt\">// staff | partner | freelancer | company | investor</span>\n name <span class=\"str\">String</span>\n email <span class=\"str\">String</span>?\n phone <span class=\"str\">String</span>?\n company <span class=\"str\">String</span>?\n stage <span class=\"str\">String</span> <span class=\"cmt\">// Contact | Opportunity | Client | Recurring Client</span>\n tags <span class=\"str\">String</span>[]\n createdAt <span class=\"str\">DateTime</span> @default(now())\n updatedAt <span class=\"str\">DateTime</span> @updatedAt\n\n projects <span class=\"str\">Project</span>[]\n contacts <span class=\"str\">Contact</span>[]\n activities <span class=\"str\">Activity</span>[]\n}\n\n<span class=\"kw\">model</span> <span class=\"str\">Project</span> {\n id <span class=\"str\">String</span> @id @default(cuid())\n name <span class=\"str\">String</span>\n description <span class=\"str\">String</span>?\n stage <span class=\"str\">String</span> <span class=\"cmt\">// Contact | Opportunity | Proposal | Implementation | Onboarding | Live | Validated</span>\n peopleId <span class=\"str\">String</span>\n people <span class=\"str\">People</span> @relation(fields: [peopleId], references: [id])\n\n conversations <span class=\"str\">Conversation</span>[]\n files <span class=\"str\">ProjectFile</span>[]\n requirements <span class=\"str\">Requirement</span>[]\n milestones <span class=\"str\">Milestone</span>[]\n collaborators <span class=\"str\">Collaborator</span>[]\n plans <span class=\"str\">ProjectPlan</span>[]\n analytics <span class=\"str\">AnalyticsRecord</span>[]\n\n createdAt <span class=\"str\">DateTime</span> @default(now())\n updatedAt <span class=\"str\">DateTime</span> @updatedAt\n}\n\n<span class=\"kw\">model</span> <span class=\"str\">Conversation</span> {\n id <span class=\"str\">String</span> @id @default(cuid())\n projectId <span class=\"str\">String</span>\n project <span class=\"str\">Project</span> @relation(fields: [projectId], references: [id])\n channel <span class=\"str\">String</span> <span class=\"cmt\">// webchat | whatsapp | email | social | gmail</span>\n direction <span class=\"str\">String</span> <span class=\"cmt\">// inbound | outbound</span>\n content <span class=\"str\">String</span>\n metadata <span class=\"str\">Json</span>?\n sentiment <span class=\"str\">Float</span>? <span class=\"cmt\">// -1 to 1</span>\n createdAt <span class=\"str\">DateTime</span> @default(now())\n}\n\n<span class=\"kw\">model</span> <span class=\"str\">AnalyticsRecord</span> {\n id <span class=\"str\">String</span> @id @default(cuid())\n projectId <span class=\"str\">String</span>\n project <span class=\"str\">Project</span> @relation(fields: [projectId], references: [id])\n sentimentScore <span class=\"str\">Float</span>?\n alignmentScore <span class=\"str\">Float</span>?\n healthScore <span class=\"str\">Float</span>?\n generatedAt <span class=\"str\">DateTime</span> @default(now())\n}\n</pre>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 12: FEATURE ROADMAP -->\n<section class=\"slide dark-alt\" id=\"s12\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">13 / 16</div>\n <h2>06 — Feature Roadmap</h2>\n\n <div class=\"grid grid-2\">\n <div>\n <h3><span class=\"badge badge-green\">MVP</span> Iterazione 1</h3>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\n <table>\n <tr><td>✅</td><td>Auth: login/register admin</td></tr>\n <tr><td>✅</td><td>People CRUD + stage management</td></tr>\n <tr><td>✅</td><td>Projects CRUD + pipeline Kanban</td></tr>\n <tr><td>✅</td><td>Project Space: tabs (Conversations, Files, Requirements, Roadmap, Collaborators, Plans)</td></tr>\n <tr><td>✅</td><td>Conversations: manual insert + timeline feed</td></tr>\n <tr><td>✅</td><td>Files & Links: upload + URL save</td></tr>\n <tr><td>✅</td><td>Requirements/Goals CRUD</td></tr>\n <tr><td>✅</td><td>Roadmap: milestones + timeline view</td></tr>\n <tr><td>✅</td><td>Collaborators: add/remove to project</td></tr>\n <tr><td>✅</td><td>Dashboard: pipeline + metric cards</td></tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div>\n <h3><span class=\"badge badge-purple\">Post-MVP</span> Features</h3>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\n <table>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>Omnichannel inbox (Chatwoot-style)</td></tr>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>Gmail sync: read + send + attachments</td></tr>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>Client portal: clienti vedono dati propri</td></tr>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>Analytics engine: AI sentiment + scoring</td></tr>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>Employee/Partner roles + permissions</td></tr>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>Webhook integrations (Zapier/n8n style)</td></tr>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>PWA mobile app</td></tr>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>AI assistant: azioni suggerite dai dati</td></tr>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>Automation rules: stage → trigger → action</td></tr>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>Export CSV, custom reports</td></tr>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>Multi-tenancy per hosting cloud</td></tr>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>Calendar sync (Google Calendar)</td></tr>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>Billing integration (Stripe)</td></tr>\n <tr><td>🔮</td><td>Knowledge base condivisa per progetto</td></tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 13: SCORING MODEL -->\n<section class=\"slide\" id=\"s13\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">14 / 16</div>\n <h2>07 — Scoring Model</h2>\n\n <div class=\"card accent-left\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\n <h4>📐 Formula Composita</h4>\n <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:monospace;color:var(--accent);margin:12px 0;\">\n Health Score = Sentiment(30%) + Alignment(25%) + Progress(20%) + Engagement(15%) + Volume(10%)\n </p>\n </div>\n\n <div class=\"grid grid-2\">\n <div class=\"card\">\n <h4>📈 Sentiment Score (30%)</h4>\n <p>Da analisi NLP conversazioni</p>\n <div class=\"score-bar\"><div class=\"score-fill\" style=\"width:75%;background:var(--accent);\"></div></div>\n <table style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n <tr><td>Positive > 65</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-green\">Good</span></td></tr>\n <tr><td>Neutral 35-65</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-amber\">Watch</span></td></tr>\n <tr><td>Negative < 35</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-rose\">Action</span></td></tr>\n </table>\n <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:8px;\">Conversazioni recenti pesano di più</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <h4>🎯 Alignment Score (25%)</h4>\n <p>Requirements/goals vs business vision</p>\n <div class=\"score-bar\"><div class=\"score-fill\" style=\"width:60%;background:var(--blue);\"></div></div>\n <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:8px;\">Manual + AI-assisted scoring, trend tracking</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <h4>📊 Progress Score (20%)</h4>\n <p>Milestones completati vs timeline</p>\n <div class=\"score-bar\"><div class=\"score-fill\" style=\"width:45%;background:var(--amber);\"></div></div>\n <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:8px;\">On-track / At-risk / Delayed</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <h4>📊 Engagement + Volume (25%)</h4>\n <p>Frequenza interazioni + volume comunicazione</p>\n <div class=\"score-bar\"><div class=\"score-fill\" style=\"width:55%;background:var(--pink);\"></div></div>\n <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:8px;\">Engagement (15%) + Communication Volume (10%)</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <div class=\"grid grid-4\" style=\"margin-top:24px;\">\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);\">Soglie Standard</p>\n <p><span class=\"badge badge-green\">80-100 Healthy</span></p>\n <p><span class=\"badge badge-amber\">60-79 At Risk</span></p>\n <p><span class=\"badge badge-rose\">0-59 Critical</span></p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);\">Generazione</p>\n <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);\">On-demand</p>\n <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);\">o via cron job</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);\">Trend</p>\n <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--green);\">↗ Improving</p>\n <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);\">storico scores</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);\">Estendibilità</p>\n <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);\">Plugin</p>\n <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);\">nuovi score via moduli</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 14: SUMMARY -->\n<section class=\"slide dark-alt\" id=\"s14\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">15 / 16</div>\n <h2>Implementation Summary</h2>\n\n <div class=\"grid grid-3\">\n <div class=\"card\">\n <h4>📦 What We're Building</h4>\n <p>CRM per tracciare People (staff, partner, freelancer, azienda, investor) che diventano Clienti, con Progetti aventi uno spazio dedicato a conversazioni cross-channel, files, requirements, roadmap, collaboratori e analytics.</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <h4>🛠️ How We Build It</h4>\n <p>TypeScript full-stack: React + shadcn/ui + Express/Fastify + Prisma + SQLite. Architettura modulare predisposta per cloud migration (PostgreSQL). Pattern ispirati a Twenty CRM, Chatwoot, Atomic CRM.</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\">\n <h4>📈 What Makes It Unique</h4>\n <p>Cross-channel conversation logging unificato, analytics layer con sentiment/alignment/health scoring, Gmail integration nativa, client portal gratuito, permission system multilivello.</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <div style=\"margin-top:40px;text-align:center;\">\n <h3 style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Ready for Implementation</h3>\n <p style=\"color:var(--text2);\">Tutti i documenti salvati in <code>~/workspace/</code></p>\n <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;margin-top:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n <span class=\"badge badge-purple\" style=\"font-size:14px;padding:8px 16px;\">CRMSpec.md</span>\n <span class=\"badge badge-blue\" style=\"font-size:14px;padding:8px 16px;\">EnsoriaManager-DISCOVERY.md</span>\n <span class=\"badge badge-green\" style=\"font-size:14px;padding:8px 16px;\">EnsoriaManager-IMPLEMENTATION-DESIGN.html</span>\n <span class=\"badge badge-amber\" style=\"font-size:14px;padding:8px 16px;\">TASKS.md</span>\n </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- SLIDE 15: READY -->\n<section class=\"slide hero\" id=\"s15\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n <div class=\"slide-number\">16 / 16</div>\n <h1>Ready to Code</h1>\n <p class=\"subtitle\" style=\"margin:0 auto;\">\n DeepSeek V4 Code attivato • Tutto il design è documentato • Pronto per l'implementazione MVP\n </p>\n <div style=\"margin-top:48px;display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;\">\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"min-width:180px;text-align:center;\">\n <p style=\"font-size:32px;margin-bottom:8px;\">🧠</p>\n <p style=\"font-weight:600;\">Ensoria Manager</p>\n <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);\">CRM × Analytics</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"min-width:180px;text-align:center;\">\n <p style=\"font-size:32px;margin-bottom:8px;\">👤</p>\n <p style=\"font-weight:600;\">People → Clienti</p>\n <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);\">Multi-type + stages</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"min-width:180px;text-align:center;\">\n <p style=\"font-size:32px;margin-bottom:8px;\">📊</p>\n <p style=\"font-weight:600;\">7 Stage Pipeline</p>\n <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);\">Contact → Validated</p>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card\" style=\"min-width:180px;text-align:center;\">\n <p style=\"font-size:32px;margin-bottom:8px;\">💬</p>\n <p style=\"font-weight:600;\">Cross-Channel</p>\n <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);\">+ Gmail L/S</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<script>\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.slide').forEach((s,i) => {\n const dot = document.createElement('div');\n dot.className = 'nav-dot';\n dot.title = s.querySelector('h2')?.textContent || 'Hero';\n dot.onclick = () => s.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});\n document.getElementById('navDots').appendChild(dot);\n});\n\nconst observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n entries.forEach(e => {\n if (e.isIntersecting) {\n document.querySelectorAll('.nav-dot').forEach((d,i) => {\n d.classList.toggle('active', i === Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.slide')).indexOf(e.target));\n });\n }\n });\n}, {threshold:0.5});\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.slide').forEach(s => observer.observe(s));\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>"}],"timestamp":1777742894704}}
